  "referenceNumber": "RUS1821",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect USM Holdings Limited is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: (1) USM Holdings Limited is itself and through its subsidiaries carrying on business in sectors of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian extractives sector and information, communications and digital technologies sector.  \n",
